    "CaskHub uses Homebrew to install and manage apps, and it doesn't seem to be installed on this Mac. Install it from brew.sh, then come back. CaskHub will pick it up automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CaskHub 依靠 Homebrew 来安装和管理应用，但这台 Mac 上似乎尚未安装。请从 brew.sh 安装后再回来，CaskHub 会自动识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CaskHub will update all %lld apps currently listed on the Updates page using Homebrew.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CaskHub 将使用 Homebrew 更新「更新」页面上当前列出的全部 %lld 个应用。"
