    "Greedy": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Helps improve CaskHub by sending anonymized usage signals via TelemetryDeck. No personal data is collected and it cannot be used to identify you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 TelemetryDeck 发送匿名使用数据，帮助改进 CaskHub。不会收集任何个人数据，也无法用于识别你的身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helps improve CaskHub's stability by sending crash reports and error diagnostics to Sentry so bugs get found and fixed faster.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向 Sentry 发送崩溃报告与错误诊断信息，帮助更快定位并修复问题，从而提升 CaskHub 的稳定性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
