    "The download doesn't match the checksum Homebrew has on record — the developer likely replaced the release file after it was published. This isn't a problem with your Mac; Homebrew refuses mismatched downloads for security. Try again in a day or two once the cask is updated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载内容与 Homebrew 记录的校验和不一致——开发者很可能在发布后替换了发行文件。这不是你的 Mac 的问题；出于安全考虑，Homebrew 会拒绝校验和不匹配的下载。请等该 Cask 更新后，过一两天再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installer for “%@” requires your login password.": {
